{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-30417","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33195","text":"webhost.systems — [&] Protocol Integration Spec (v1)"}]},{"id":"blk-30418","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33196","text":"Version: 1.0 Status: Draft Audience: Engineering Last updated: 2026-03-28"}]},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30420","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33197","text":"This document extends the v1 spec to make WebHost.Systems the canonical hosting layer for [&] Protocol agents."}]}],"id":"blk-30419","kind":"quote"},{"id":"blk-30421","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33198","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-30422","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33199","text":"0) Context"}]},{"id":"blk-30423","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33200","text":"WebHost.Systems currently treats agents as opaque code bundles deployed to Cloudflare Workers or AWS AgentCore. To serve as the hosting platform for the [&] Protocol ecosystem, WHS must understand "},{"id":"spn-33201","marks":["bold"],"text":"capability declarations"},{"id":"spn-33202","text":", "},{"id":"spn-33203","marks":["bold"],"text":"MCP sidecar orchestration"},{"id":"spn-33204","text":", "},{"id":"spn-33205","marks":["bold"],"text":"agent-to-agent skill routing"},{"id":"spn-33206","text":", and "},{"id":"spn-33207","marks":["bold"],"text":"governance enforcement"},{"id":"spn-33208","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-30424","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33209","text":"This spec adds [&]-aware features as phased extensions to the existing v1 architecture. The current CRUD/deploy/invoke/telemetry foundation remains intact."}]},{"id":"blk-30425","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33210","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-30426","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33211","text":"1) Capability Manifests (ampersand.json)"}]},{"id":"blk-30427","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33212","text":"1.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-30428","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33213","text":"Agents currently declare only "},{"id":"spn-33214","marks":["code"],"text":"name"},{"id":"spn-33215","text":", "},{"id":"spn-33216","marks":["code"],"text":"description"},{"id":"spn-33217","text":", "},{"id":"spn-33218","marks":["code"],"text":"framework"},{"id":"spn-33219","text":", and "},{"id":"spn-33220","marks":["code"],"text":"runtimeProvider"},{"id":"spn-33221","text":". There is no way for the platform to know what capabilities an agent uses ("},{"id":"spn-33222","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-33223","text":", "},{"id":"spn-33224","marks":["code"],"text":"&time.anomaly"},{"id":"spn-33225","text":", etc.) or what it provides."}]},{"id":"blk-30429","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33226","text":"1.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-30430","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33227","text":"Support an optional "},{"id":"spn-33228","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-33229","text":" manifest alongside the agent code bundle. When present, WHS validates it against the [&] Protocol schema and uses it for:"}]},{"id":"blk-30431","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30433","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33230","text":"Capability-aware deployment (auto-provision required MCP sidecars)"}]}],"id":"blk-30432","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30435","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33231","text":"FleetPrompt registry integration (publish agent capabilities)"}]}],"id":"blk-30434","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30437","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33232","text":"Governance enforcement (Delegatic policy checks)"}]}],"id":"blk-30436","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-30438","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33233","text":"1.3 Schema"}]},{"id":"blk-30439","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33234","text":"The manifest follows "},{"id":"spn-33235","marks":["code"],"text":"AmpersandBoxDesign/protocol/schema/v0.1.0/ampersand.schema.json"},{"id":"spn-33236","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-30440","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33237","text":"Key fields for WHS:"}]},{"id":"blk-30441","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"agent\": \"my-agent\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"capabilities\": {\n    \"uses\": [\"&memory.graph\", \"&time.anomaly\", \"&reason.deliberate\"],\n    \"provides\": [\"&space.fleet.locate\"]\n  },\n  \"providers\": {\n    \"&memory.graph\": { \"provider\": \"graphonomous\", \"config\": { \"db\": \"auto\" } },\n    \"&time.anomaly\": { \"provider\": \"ticktickclock\" },\n    \"&reason.deliberate\": { \"provider\": \"auto\" }\n  },\n  \"governance\": {\n    \"autonomy\": \"advise\",\n    \"constraints\": { \"hard\": [\"no_network_without_approval\"], \"soft\": [] }\n  },\n  \"mcp_servers\": [\"graphonomous\", \"ticktickclock\"]\n}"},{"id":"blk-30442","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33238","text":"1.4 Data Model Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-30443","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33239","text":"Add to "},{"id":"spn-33240","marks":["code"],"text":"agents"},{"id":"spn-33241","text":" table:"}]},{"id":"blk-30444","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"ampersandManifest: optional JSON blob (validated against schema on deploy)\ncapabilitiesUsed: optional string[] (denormalized from manifest for search/filter)\ncapabilitiesProvided: optional string[] (denormalized for registry)"},{"id":"blk-30445","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33242","text":"1.5 Validation"}]},{"id":"blk-30446","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33243","text":"On deployment, if "},{"id":"spn-33244","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-33245","text":" is present in the bundle: 1. Validate against [&] schema (reuse "},{"id":"spn-33246","marks":["code"],"text":"@ampersand-protocol/validate"},{"id":"spn-33247","text":" npm package) 2. Extract "},{"id":"spn-33248","marks":["code"],"text":"capabilities.uses"},{"id":"spn-33249","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-33250","marks":["code"],"text":"capabilities.provides"},{"id":"spn-33251","text":" 3. Verify all declared providers are available in the deployment environment 4. Store validated manifest in "},{"id":"spn-33252","marks":["code"],"text":"agents.ampersandManifest"}]},{"id":"blk-30447","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33253","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-30448","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33254","text":"2) MCP Sidecar Orchestration"}]},{"id":"blk-30449","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33255","text":"2.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-30450","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33256","text":"[&] agents compose capabilities via MCP servers (Graphonomous for "},{"id":"spn-33257","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-33258","text":", TickTickClock for "},{"id":"spn-33259","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-33260","text":", etc.). Currently WHS deploys agents in isolation with no MCP server connectivity."}]},{"id":"blk-30451","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33261","text":"2.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-30452","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33262","marks":["bold"],"text":"Phase 1 — Linked MCP services"},{"id":"spn-33263","text":": Allow agents to declare MCP server dependencies. WHS provisions and manages these as linked services (similar to linked databases in PaaS platforms)."}]},{"id":"blk-30453","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33264","marks":["bold"],"text":"Phase 2 — MCP sidecar model"},{"id":"spn-33265","text":": For Cloudflare Workers, run MCP servers as Durable Object sidecars. For AgentCore, use linked Lambda/container sidecars."}]},{"id":"blk-30454","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33266","text":"2.3 Configuration"}]},{"id":"blk-30455","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33267","text":"In "},{"id":"spn-33268","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-33269","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-30456","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"mcp_servers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"graphonomous\",\n      \"transport\": \"streamable_http\",\n      \"config\": {\n        \"db_path\": \"auto\",\n        \"embedder_backend\": \"fallback\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"},{"id":"blk-30457","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33270","text":"2.4 Data Model Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-30458","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33271","text":"New table: "},{"id":"spn-33272","marks":["code"],"text":"linkedServices"}]},{"id":"blk-30459","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agentId: Id<\"agents\">\nserviceType: \"mcp_server\" | \"database\" | \"cache\"\nserviceName: string\nproviderRef: string (provider-specific endpoint/identifier)\nconfig: JSON\nstatus: \"provisioning\" | \"active\" | \"error\" | \"deprovisioned\"\ncreatedAt: number"},{"id":"blk-30460","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33273","text":"2.5 Runtime Provider Interface Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-30461","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33274","text":"Add to RPI (§20):"}]},{"id":"blk-30462","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface RuntimeProviderAdapter {\n  // ... existing methods ...\n\n  // Phase 2: MCP sidecar support\n  provisionLinkedService?(agentId: string, service: LinkedServiceConfig): Promise<ServiceRef>;\n  deprovisionLinkedService?(agentId: string, serviceRef: string): Promise<void>;\n  getLinkedServiceEndpoint?(agentId: string, serviceName: string): Promise<string>;\n}"},{"id":"blk-30463","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33275","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-30464","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33276","text":"3) Agent-to-Agent Skill Routing (A2A)"}]},{"id":"blk-30465","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33277","text":"3.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-30466","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33278","text":"Currently only human→agent invocation is supported. [&] agents need to invoke skills on other agents (e.g., a fleet coordinator querying a spatial intelligence agent)."}]},{"id":"blk-30467","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33279","text":"3.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-30468","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33280","text":"Add A2A invocation support using the A2A protocol (agent-to-agent, complementary to MCP):"}]},{"id":"blk-30469","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33281","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-33282","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skill declaration"},{"id":"spn-33283","text":": Agents declare "},{"id":"spn-33284","marks":["code"],"text":"a2a_skills"},{"id":"spn-33285","text":" in their manifest 2. "},{"id":"spn-33286","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skill discovery"},{"id":"spn-33287","text":": WHS maintains an internal skill registry (derived from manifests) 3. "},{"id":"spn-33288","marks":["bold"],"text":"Skill invocation"},{"id":"spn-33289","text":": Agents can invoke skills on other agents via a WHS-mediated endpoint 4. "},{"id":"spn-33290","marks":["bold"],"text":"Governance"},{"id":"spn-33291","text":": All A2A calls pass through Delegatic policy checks"}]},{"id":"blk-30470","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33292","text":"3.3 API Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-30471","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"POST /api/v1/a2a/invoke\n{\n  \"caller_agent_id\": \"agent_abc\",\n  \"skill\": \"fleet-state-enrichment\",\n  \"input\": { ... },\n  \"session_id\": \"optional\"\n}"},{"id":"blk-30472","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33293","text":"WHS resolves the skill to a target agent, checks governance policies, invokes the target, and returns the result."}]},{"id":"blk-30473","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33294","text":"3.4 Data Model Extension"}]},{"id":"blk-30474","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33295","text":"New table: "},{"id":"spn-33296","marks":["code"],"text":"skillRegistry"}]},{"id":"blk-30475","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"agentId: Id<\"agents\">\nskill: string\ncapability: string (&space.fleet, etc.)\nstatus: \"active\" | \"inactive\""},{"id":"blk-30476","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33297","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-30477","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33298","text":"4) Governance Enforcement (Delegatic Integration)"}]},{"id":"blk-30478","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33299","text":"4.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-30479","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33300","text":"WHS currently enforces only tier-based billing limits. [&] agents need governance enforcement: hard/soft constraints, autonomy levels, goal-aware authorization, and audit trails."}]},{"id":"blk-30480","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33301","text":"4.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-30481","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33302","text":"Integrate with Delegatic for governance:"}]},{"id":"blk-30482","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33303","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-33304","marks":["bold"],"text":"Policy attachment"},{"id":"spn-33305","text":": Link agents to Delegatic org/policy trees 2. "},{"id":"spn-33306","marks":["bold"],"text":"Pre-invocation check"},{"id":"spn-33307","text":": Before invoking an agent, check Delegatic policies 3. "},{"id":"spn-33308","marks":["bold"],"text":"Audit forwarding"},{"id":"spn-33309","text":": Forward invocation telemetry to Delegatic audit trail 4. "},{"id":"spn-33310","marks":["bold"],"text":"Autonomy enforcement"},{"id":"spn-33311","text":": Respect "},{"id":"spn-33312","marks":["code"],"text":"observe | advise | act"},{"id":"spn-33313","text":" autonomy levels from manifests"}]},{"id":"blk-30483","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33314","text":"4.3 Configuration"}]},{"id":"blk-30484","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33315","text":"In "},{"id":"spn-33316","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-33317","text":":"}]},{"id":"blk-30485","kind":"code","language":"json","text":"{\n  \"governance\": {\n    \"delegatic_org_id\": \"org_xyz\",\n    \"autonomy\": \"advise\",\n    \"constraints\": {\n      \"hard\": [\"no_network_without_approval\", \"no_filesystem_write\"],\n      \"soft\": [\"prefer_local_inference\"]\n    }\n  }\n}"},{"id":"blk-30486","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33318","text":"4.4 Invocation Flow Change"}]},{"id":"blk-30487","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33319","text":"Updated Flow C (Invoke agent): 1. Client calls "},{"id":"spn-33320","marks":["code"],"text":"POST /invoke/:agentId"},{"id":"spn-33321","text":" 2. Control plane authenticates/authorizes 3. "},{"id":"spn-33322","marks":["bold"],"text":"NEW"},{"id":"spn-33323","text":": If agent has governance config, call Delegatic policy check 4. Check plan limits and agent status 5. Route to runtime provider 6. "},{"id":"spn-33324","marks":["bold"],"text":"NEW"},{"id":"spn-33325","text":": Forward telemetry to Delegatic audit 7. Return response"}]},{"id":"blk-30488","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33326","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-30489","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33327","text":"5) Provider Registry (Dynamic Resolution)"}]},{"id":"blk-30490","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33328","text":"5.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-30491","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33329","text":"Runtime providers (Cloudflare, AgentCore) are hardcoded. [&] agents declare capability providers that should be resolved dynamically (e.g., "},{"id":"spn-33330","marks":["code"],"text":"\"provider\": \"auto\""},{"id":"spn-33331","text":" should resolve to the best available provider for "},{"id":"spn-33332","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory.graph"},{"id":"spn-33333","text":")."}]},{"id":"blk-30492","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33334","text":"5.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-30493","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33335","text":"Add a capability provider registry to WHS:"}]},{"id":"blk-30494","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Provider: graphonomous → Capabilities: [&memory.graph, &memory.consolidate, &reason.deliberate, &reason.attend]\nProvider: ticktickclock → Capabilities: [&time.anomaly, &time.forecast, &time.pattern]\nProvider: geofleetic → Capabilities: [&space.fleet, &space.route, &space.geofence]\nProvider: bendscript → Capabilities: [&memory.graph (KAG)]"},{"id":"blk-30495","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33336","text":"When "},{"id":"spn-33337","marks":["code"],"text":"\"provider\": \"auto\""},{"id":"spn-33338","text":", WHS resolves to the best available provider based on: 1. Capability match 2. Provider availability in deployment region 3. Cost tier of the user's plan 4. Governance constraints"}]},{"id":"blk-30496","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33339","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-30497","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33340","text":"6) Provenance and Audit Trail"}]},{"id":"blk-30498","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33341","text":"6.1 Problem"}]},{"id":"blk-30499","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33342","text":"Currently invocations have basic "},{"id":"spn-33343","marks":["code"],"text":"traceId"},{"id":"spn-33344","text":" but no hash-linked provenance chain. For [&] agents, every decision should be traceable back through the capability calls that informed it."}]},{"id":"blk-30500","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33345","text":"6.2 Solution"}]},{"id":"blk-30501","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33346","text":"Extend telemetry events with provenance fields:"}]},{"id":"blk-30502","kind":"code","language":"typescript","text":"interface TelemetryEvent {\n  // ... existing fields ...\n\n  // [&] provenance extension\n  ampersand?: {\n    capabilities_invoked: string[];      // [\"&memory.graph.recall\", \"&time.anomaly.detect\"]\n    routing_decision: \"fast\" | \"deliberate\";  // κ routing result\n    kappa_value?: number;                // cyclicity score if deliberation was triggered\n    goal_id?: string;                    // Graphonomous GoalGraph reference\n    provenance_hash?: string;            // hash-linked to parent invocation\n    a2a_calls?: {\n      target_agent: string;\n      skill: string;\n      duration_ms: number;\n    }[];\n  };\n}"},{"id":"blk-30503","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33347","text":"---"}]},{"id":"blk-30504","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33348","text":"7) Implementation Phases"}]},{"id":"blk-30505","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33349","text":"Phase 1 — Manifest Support (lowest lift, highest signal)"}]},{"id":"blk-30506","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30508","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33350","text":"[ ] Accept "},{"id":"spn-33351","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand.json"},{"id":"spn-33352","text":" in deployment bundles"}]}],"id":"blk-30507","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30510","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33353","text":"[ ] Validate against [&] schema using "},{"id":"spn-33354","marks":["code"],"text":"@ampersand-protocol/validate"}]}],"id":"blk-30509","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30512","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33355","text":"[ ] Store manifest + denormalized capabilities in "},{"id":"spn-33356","marks":["code"],"text":"agents"},{"id":"spn-33357","text":" table"}]}],"id":"blk-30511","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30514","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33358","text":"[ ] Add capability filter to agent list API"}]}],"id":"blk-30513","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30516","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33359","text":"[ ] Update dashboard to show declared capabilities"}]}],"id":"blk-30515","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-30517","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-33360","text":"Phase 2 — MCP Linked Services"}]},{"id":"blk-30518","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30520","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33361","text":"[ ] Design linked service provisioning for Cloudflare (Durable Object sidecars)"}]}],"id":"blk-30519","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-30522","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-33362","text":"[ ] Design linked service provi